OL,3,GGrampian                               
OL,5,CToday:FA frosty start for most then it 
OL,6,Fwill be a mainly dry and bright day    
OL,7,Fwith some long sunny spells. There may 
OL,8,Fbe the odd shower across Buchan.       
OL,10,CTonight:FA dry evening, some clear     
OL,11,Fspells, frost returning in more        
OL,12,Fsheltered areas but overall            
OL,13,Fsoutheasterly winds will be            
OL,14,Fstrengthening with temperatures        
OL,15,Flifting above freezing.                
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
