OL,3,GGrampian                               
OL,5,CTuesday:FA bright start in Buchan and  
OL,6,Fnortheast, otherwise cloudy with       
OL,7,Foutbreaks of rain developing, this     
OL,8,Flight and patchy over Moray and Banff  
OL,9,Fbut heavier across southern            
OL,10,FAberdeenshire, hill snow. Windy.       
OL,12,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FCloudy
OL,13,Fwith further rain on Wednesday         
OL,14,Fgradually easing. Mainly dry and       
OL,15,Fbright on Thursday. Dry start Friday   
OL,16,Fthen rain arriving from the west later.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
